3. Sound effects
===============================================================================

The 22 WAV files in assets/audio/ were generated procedurally for this project
(filtered noise and damped resonances for tile and claim cues; synthesized tones
for the win, draw, and timer stings). They contain no third-party samples and
are original work covered by this project's licence. The generator is not part
of this repository; its provenance is kept with the private zj-server work.

